        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion V8, Aaronson Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Aaronson Modern Handleset has substance, making it a great choice for larger doors. And the contemporary design makes it a popular choice for modern homes. Made out of solid brass, it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.  It is available in polished chrome, brushed nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose the inside knob or lever that fits your personal style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Aaronson Front Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion V8 Modern Aaronson Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2 on center door boring</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Aaronson Modern Handleset, Fusion V8",
                "description": "Fusion V8, Aaronson Modern Handleset -- The Aaronson Modern Handleset has substance, making it a great choice for larger doors. And the contemporary design makes it a popular choice for modern homes. Made out of solid brass, it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.  It is available in polished chrome, brushed nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose the inside knob or lever that fits your personal style.",
